    <briefdescription>
<para>Roofed Asian option on a number of assets. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The payoff is a given fraction multiplied by the minimum between a given roof and the positive portfolio performance. If the performance of the portfolio is below then the payoff is null.</para><para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000014"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This implementation still does not manage seasoned options.</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
